WEBVTT

00:10.180 --> 00:14.400
O Sir Crawford, wherefore art thou Sir Crawford?

00:14.400 --> 00:17.300
I will leave the name of Crawford as of today.

00:17.300 --> 00:20.920
Let us leave this town and live together.

00:21.150 --> 00:22.150
Yes!

00:38.120 --> 00:39.340
Charlotte.

00:40.980 --> 00:42.410
Allen.

00:48.340 --> 00:50.180
Cut!

00:50.430 --> 00:53.200
You think you can cut 
corners by using magic?!

00:59.920 --> 01:02.170
No, that wasn't the intention...

01:02.170 --> 01:03.470
Then what is it?

01:03.700 --> 01:08.950
Well... the princess carry is a bit... embarrassing...

01:08.950 --> 01:11.660
What are you, eight?

01:14.050 --> 01:18.590
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

02:42.390 --> 02:46.770
<b>Naughty Skits</b>

02:46.850 --> 02:49.760
It seems absolutely impossible for
you two to flirt on your own,

02:49.760 --> 02:52.000
so I prepared a script.

02:52.000 --> 02:53.280
What's your problem?!

02:54.260 --> 02:57.020
<i>I knew I shouldn't have accepted 
this offer so casually.</i>

02:57.020 --> 03:03.880
For the sake of the new novel by extraordinary
author, Dorothea Gri'mm Wallenstein,

03:03.880 --> 03:07.770
I will need to you act lovey-dovey 
right here, right now!

03:08.220 --> 03:11.300
I didn't even make you kiss!

03:11.300 --> 03:12.780
K-Kiss?!

03:13.020 --> 03:14.970
Just follow the script and flirt.

03:14.970 --> 03:17.670
Then Mister Allen can have the mansion.

03:17.670 --> 03:19.800
I get inspiration for my next novel.

03:19.800 --> 03:21.670
It's a win-win situation!

03:22.430 --> 03:24.480
<i>It's for the mansion.</i>

03:24.480 --> 03:25.990
<i>I have no choice.</i>

03:26.480 --> 03:27.320
<i>But!</i>

03:27.690 --> 03:30.590
No, I will have to decline.

03:30.590 --> 03:32.570
I'm sure Charlotte hates the idea, too!

03:32.570 --> 03:34.440
M-Me?

03:34.440 --> 03:38.190
It's impossible to flirt with 
a guy she doesn't even like.

03:38.600 --> 03:42.240
Um, it's not impossible.

03:42.920 --> 03:45.580
See, Charlotte agrees with me...

03:46.080 --> 03:46.960
Huh?!

03:47.300 --> 03:50.440
I don't mind it if it's with you, Allen...

03:51.250 --> 03:52.950
My goodness, Allen?!

03:53.390 --> 03:55.720
A-Are you okay?!

03:56.320 --> 03:57.730
I'm fine.

03:57.730 --> 04:01.700
I almost lost myself there, 
so I applied some first aid.

04:01.700 --> 04:05.230
O-Oh no, your face is all bloody!

04:05.230 --> 04:08.220
Y-Yes, but it's not a problem.

04:08.490 --> 04:10.850
They're flirting naturally.

04:10.850 --> 04:12.100
That's it!

04:12.100 --> 04:14.220
Give me more of it!

04:14.540 --> 04:18.480
But if I leave it up to your pacing, 
even I would die of old age.

04:18.480 --> 04:21.480
So I'm gonna ask you to stick to the script.

04:21.910 --> 04:24.130
<i>I've acted it out once and now I know.</i>

04:24.130 --> 04:27.540
<i>It's dangerous to follow her 
script in all kinds of ways.</i>

04:27.540 --> 04:31.490
<i>But if I don't, I might be 
evicted from the mansion!</i>

04:31.810 --> 04:33.990
Allen, let's do our best.

04:33.990 --> 04:38.340
<i>Since Charlotte is up for it, 
I'll have to brace myself!</i>

04:38.860 --> 04:39.850
Fine!

04:39.850 --> 04:41.000
I'll do it!

04:41.000 --> 04:42.010
However!

04:42.270 --> 04:46.380
I will refuse anything that violates 
public order and morality!

04:46.690 --> 04:48.620
Bring it on.

04:48.620 --> 04:54.660
I shall give a hand to help 
the youngsters in love.

04:54.660 --> 04:56.710
Mommy is mine and no one else's!

04:56.710 --> 04:58.410
I won't help!

04:58.770 --> 05:00.790
But it looks kinda fun...

05:00.790 --> 05:02.890
So I guess I could be talked into it?

05:02.890 --> 05:05.290
Good! That settles it!

05:05.290 --> 05:07.660
Here's the new script.

05:07.660 --> 05:10.870
All you need to do is to follow it!

05:13.420 --> 05:15.920
Hey! We're newlyweds?!

05:22.520 --> 05:24.680
Ready, action!

05:34.270 --> 05:36.350
hELlo. I aM homE—

05:35.850 --> 05:36.940
Cut!

05:36.940 --> 05:38.290
You ham actor!

05:38.290 --> 05:39.710
Watch your accent!

05:39.710 --> 05:41.450
Be more natural!

05:41.710 --> 05:42.900
S-Sorry.

05:42.900 --> 05:46.200
I get nervous thinking 
that I'm being watched.

05:46.200 --> 05:48.970
And what is this get up?

05:48.970 --> 05:53.710
If you object to the setting I came 
up with, I'll take my mansion back.

05:54.490 --> 05:55.650
Please don't!

05:55.650 --> 05:57.220
I'll do it properly next time!

05:57.220 --> 05:58.860
Let's try it again.

05:58.860 --> 06:00.700
Ready, action!

06:02.830 --> 06:04.970
Hello. I'm home.

06:05.320 --> 06:07.460
Hello, dear.

06:07.790 --> 06:09.210
Welcome home.

06:11.420 --> 06:12.720
<i>Again...</i>

06:13.500 --> 06:15.220
Is something the matter?

06:15.520 --> 06:17.920
Oh no, it's nothing.

06:18.230 --> 06:23.720
Would you like dinner, a bath, or....

06:25.530 --> 06:27.560
A piece of this?

06:29.100 --> 06:30.750
Cut, cut!

06:31.810 --> 06:34.380
What do you think you're doing?!

06:34.380 --> 06:36.740
I didn't instruct you to do that!

06:37.040 --> 06:39.240
Are you all right, Allen?

06:39.240 --> 06:43.850
I thought I read it according to 
the script, but did I mess up?

06:43.850 --> 06:46.320
No, you didn't.

06:46.760 --> 06:47.750
What's messed up is...

06:47.750 --> 06:49.520
You, Dorothea!

06:49.520 --> 06:52.000
What are you making Charlotte say?!

06:52.000 --> 06:55.020
What? It's nothing crazy.

06:55.020 --> 06:58.820
Look, you can't make 
Charlotte say weird stuff.

06:58.820 --> 07:00.520
Okay, fine.

07:00.850 --> 07:01.950
<i>Damn it!</i>

07:01.950 --> 07:05.700
<i>If it weren't for the mansion's ownership 
issue, a farce like this...!</i>

07:06.160 --> 07:08.290
Okay, let's keep going!

07:08.290 --> 07:10.030
Ready, action!

07:10.770 --> 07:13.450
I made some stew today.

07:13.450 --> 07:17.040
The carrots are cut up like bunnies, see?

07:17.350 --> 07:21.040
<i>As expected of Charlotte, her acting is so natural.</i>

07:21.040 --> 07:24.300
<i>She can be the best actress in the world!</i>

07:24.300 --> 07:26.550
Please eat it while it's hot.

07:26.550 --> 07:27.460
Okay.

07:28.150 --> 07:29.290
Thank you for the food.

07:29.560 --> 07:31.790
Here. Open wide...

07:34.790 --> 07:36.330
Ah...

07:38.470 --> 07:41.300
<i>See? I can do it when I put my mind to it!</i>

07:41.300 --> 07:43.320
Is it yummy, Al-Al?

07:44.300 --> 07:45.860
A... Al-Al?!

07:45.860 --> 07:47.820
Cut, cut!

07:49.850 --> 07:52.580
It was going so well...

07:52.840 --> 07:55.510
Allen, are you okay?

07:55.510 --> 07:56.720
Hey, Dorothea.

07:56.720 --> 07:58.810
What the heck is Al-Al, huh?!

07:59.060 --> 08:01.450
You're supposed to be newlyweds,

08:01.450 --> 08:04.210
so it's normal to have
nicknames for each other.

08:04.510 --> 08:07.460
By the way, Miss Charlotte's 
nickname is Charly.

08:07.720 --> 08:09.020
Charly?!

08:10.210 --> 08:11.510
Well, whatever.

08:11.510 --> 08:15.210
If this is really going to help 
you with your next book...

08:15.210 --> 08:17.220
Of course it does!

08:17.500 --> 08:21.710
<i>It only looks like she's having 
fun toying with us...</i>

08:21.960 --> 08:25.960
That's enough for the newlyweds 
setting, so let's move on!

08:25.960 --> 08:27.980
Next is the school-life situation!

08:28.920 --> 08:30.740
We're not done yet?

08:31.010 --> 08:35.490
Oh, there are other characters 
besides the two of you though.

08:35.780 --> 08:38.340
Who can we cast...?

08:38.340 --> 08:41.320
If I may be so bold, I 
would take on a role.

08:45.380 --> 08:47.500
How about this?

08:48.370 --> 08:51.640
I mean, I didn't know you 
were a female, Miss Gosetsu.

08:52.040 --> 08:53.640
<i>That's</i> your reaction?

08:53.640 --> 08:56.010
But you're perfect for the role!

08:56.340 --> 08:57.770
I want in, too!

08:57.770 --> 08:58.970
Okay!

08:58.970 --> 09:00.520
Are you ready?

09:00.520 --> 09:02.520
Ready, action!

09:03.970 --> 09:07.440
<i>A lone-wolf punk, Allen Crawford.</i>

09:07.440 --> 09:11.770
<i>One day, his childhood friend, Charlotte, 
gets kidnapped by thugs.</i>

09:11.770 --> 09:16.590
<i>To rescue her, Allen enters enemy territory all alone.</i>

09:17.710 --> 09:20.020
Are you okay, Charlotte?

09:20.320 --> 09:21.580
Allen!

09:22.760 --> 09:24.050
You're here.

09:24.740 --> 09:26.530
Give Charlotte back.

09:26.840 --> 09:31.040
If you want this woman back, 
try and take her by force!

09:31.460 --> 09:33.060
You'll regret it.

09:33.060 --> 09:35.050
Let's see what you've got!

09:41.470 --> 09:42.320
There!

09:47.830 --> 09:51.490
Looks like you've got some 
backbone like the rumors said.

09:51.490 --> 09:53.650
Come join us.

09:53.650 --> 09:55.150
No, thank you!

09:55.150 --> 09:57.150
Are you sure?

09:57.670 --> 10:00.280
You don't care what happens to that girl?

10:01.730 --> 10:03.140
What?

10:06.330 --> 10:09.130
Try laying even one finger on Charlotte.

10:09.130 --> 10:11.910
I'll grind you to pieces!

10:14.990 --> 10:15.800
Huh?

10:25.080 --> 10:27.050
What power...

10:27.340 --> 10:29.820
As expected from Allen...

10:30.320 --> 10:32.310
Are you okay, Charlotte?

10:32.590 --> 10:36.070
I'm sorry, this is all my fault...

10:36.070 --> 10:39.820
Sorry, I didn't mean to fight.

10:39.820 --> 10:43.570
No, you did it to help me.

10:45.290 --> 10:48.590
I'd never be scared of you.

10:49.480 --> 10:50.550
A woman...

10:53.590 --> 10:56.360
A woman who's precious to me.

10:57.650 --> 10:59.170
<i>It takes me back.</i>

10:59.170 --> 11:02.850
<i>Something similar happened when 
she got caught up with those thugs.</i>

11:03.070 --> 11:05.330
I'll go wet a handkerchief.

11:05.840 --> 11:06.780
<i>Shoot!</i>

11:06.780 --> 11:09.890
<i>I'm supposed to chase after her in the script.</i>

11:10.630 --> 11:11.670
Hold on!

11:13.450 --> 11:15.060
What's the matter?

11:16.340 --> 11:20.430
<i>And here, I'm supposed to do a Kabe-don, 
then an Ago-kui, into a Kata-zun...</i>

11:20.430 --> 11:21.830
<i>What do these words even </i>mean<i>?!</i>

11:21.830 --> 11:23.990
<i>I've never heard of them before!</i>

11:23.990 --> 11:27.460
<i>"Kabe" means wall, so I guess I'm 
supposed to put my hands against the wall?</i>

11:31.380 --> 11:33.800
Oh no, it's just...

11:34.810 --> 11:36.070
<i>It's happening again.</i>

11:36.070 --> 11:40.090
<i>When I look at Charlotte, sometimes my heart leaps.</i>

11:40.750 --> 11:45.510
<i>Her every gesture and behavior stirs up my heart.</i>

11:46.350 --> 11:49.250
<i>Could it be possible that I...?</i>

11:50.470 --> 11:54.420
Allen... Who is that woman to you?

11:54.420 --> 11:57.960
Storming right into enemy territory for her, that's something!

11:59.000 --> 12:01.060
<i>Charlotte, to me, is...</i>

12:02.620 --> 12:04.090
<i>This is a performance.</i>

12:04.090 --> 12:06.370
<i>I'm not telling her how I feel.</i>

12:06.370 --> 12:07.290
<i>So...</i>

12:10.970 --> 12:13.900
I'm... I'm her...

12:14.460 --> 12:15.790
Guardian!

12:15.790 --> 12:19.160
I need to be by her side and look out for her!

12:19.160 --> 12:20.680
Cut, cut!

12:20.680 --> 12:23.710
Excuse me?! Did I say you 
could go off script?

12:23.710 --> 12:28.420
That's where you go, "She 
is a part of my heart"!

12:28.420 --> 12:29.810
I improvised.

12:29.810 --> 12:32.930
I changed it because I 
thought that was better.

12:32.930 --> 12:36.670
Why do I feel like you're 
doing some fast talking...

12:36.670 --> 12:38.440
Oh well, whatever!

12:42.230 --> 12:44.690
<i>Charlotte is sweet and gentle.</i>

12:44.690 --> 12:49.750
<i>If I tell her how I feel, she'd feel 
obliged to reciprocate my feelings.</i>

12:50.870 --> 12:53.440
<i>That is beyond naughty.</i>

12:53.960 --> 12:56.960
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

12:56.960 --> 12:59.960
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

13:00.420 --> 13:03.420
Next, you'll be doing a Cinderella story.

13:03.680 --> 13:04.880
We're not done yet?

13:04.880 --> 13:06.190
Of course not!

13:06.520 --> 13:08.170
I'm getting tired.

13:08.420 --> 13:11.180
Charlotte, can you tell Dorothea as well?

13:11.180 --> 13:13.350
I'm actually having fun.

13:13.350 --> 13:16.690
But if you're tired, we could call it a day.

13:16.690 --> 13:18.860
This isn't enough to make me tired!

13:18.860 --> 13:20.180
I can keep going!

13:20.550 --> 13:22.120
Thank you!

13:22.560 --> 13:26.370
Dorothea, am I doing it correctly?

13:26.370 --> 13:28.200
I've never acted before.

13:28.200 --> 13:30.690
Miss Charlotte, you're perfect!

13:31.130 --> 13:32.690
Thank you!

13:32.690 --> 13:34.950
Here's your next script.

13:35.170 --> 13:38.470
Mister Allen will be playing 
a prince on a white horse,

13:38.470 --> 13:43.210
and Miss Charlotte will be a 
mistreated, unfortunate princess.

13:43.490 --> 13:46.850
And the mean stepmother will be Gosetsu—

13:46.850 --> 13:48.720
What about me?

13:48.990 --> 13:51.720
I have the perfect role for you!

13:51.720 --> 13:53.230
Yay!

13:53.230 --> 13:56.220
Now that it's cast, let's roll!

13:56.220 --> 13:57.970
Ready, action!

13:59.740 --> 14:01.960
Charlotte is the daughter of a mistress,

14:01.960 --> 14:05.740
and has been mistreated 
by her stepmother every day.

14:06.300 --> 14:09.330
<i>This reminds me of my past.</i>

14:09.330 --> 14:12.180
<i>Before I came to Allen's place,</i>

14:12.180 --> 14:15.040
<i>my daily routine was to clean the Duke's mansion...</i>

14:17.900 --> 14:19.870
I still see some dust.

14:19.870 --> 14:22.500
Do it all over again, Charlotte!

14:22.770 --> 14:25.010
I'm so sorry, Mother.

14:25.320 --> 14:26.840
No matter.

14:26.840 --> 14:31.760
By the way, we received a invitation 
for a ball from the kingdom.

14:32.040 --> 14:36.660
But I expect you to finish cleaning \this place by the time I come home.

14:36.660 --> 14:38.570
Yes, Mother.

14:42.860 --> 14:45.190
I can't keep on living like this.

14:47.250 --> 14:50.950
Why should I suffer like this?!

14:54.350 --> 14:56.450
Wh-Who are you?

14:56.450 --> 14:58.550
I'm a sorcerer.

14:58.550 --> 15:02.290
Poor dear, I'll take you to the ball.

15:02.290 --> 15:03.120
Here!

15:07.700 --> 15:09.800
Wow, it's beautiful!

15:10.130 --> 15:11.800
Now, let us go!

15:27.020 --> 15:29.610
I disobeyed Mother to be here.

15:29.610 --> 15:33.080
Should a person like me be at the ball?

15:36.300 --> 15:38.590
Why is she here?!

15:43.590 --> 15:44.730
No way!

15:44.730 --> 15:47.430
Is that... the prince?!

15:49.300 --> 15:50.810
You look beautiful.

15:50.810 --> 15:53.090
Th-Thank you.

15:55.710 --> 15:59.110
<i>Allen looks gorgeous in a prince's outfit.</i>

15:59.480 --> 16:04.790
If... you don't mind, would you dance with me?

16:05.610 --> 16:09.100
But I've never danced before...

16:09.390 --> 16:10.660
What a coincidence.

16:10.660 --> 16:11.730
Neither have I.

16:11.730 --> 16:13.360
Come on, let's dance.

16:16.650 --> 16:17.960
Y-Yes.

16:23.340 --> 16:24.800
Lift your chin up.

16:25.220 --> 16:28.090
It's easier to stay in sync that way.

16:28.090 --> 16:29.490
O-Okay...

16:37.230 --> 16:38.510
<i>Somehow...</i>

16:41.020 --> 16:43.260
<i>My heart is pounding.</i>

16:47.930 --> 16:51.020
<i>When I'm with Allen, I...</i>

16:53.770 --> 16:55.540
Cut!

16:58.000 --> 17:01.430
Miss Charlotte, you were a perfect princess!

17:01.430 --> 17:03.310
Thank you.

17:03.310 --> 17:05.040
Mister Allen, you were okay.

17:05.280 --> 17:06.340
How so?!

17:06.340 --> 17:08.290
I did my best!

17:08.290 --> 17:10.250
Mommy, have some water.

17:10.250 --> 17:11.930
Great work.

17:11.930 --> 17:13.540
Thank you.

17:15.520 --> 17:18.870
As expected of Lady Charlotte.
It was a masterful performance.

17:18.870 --> 17:20.800
That's an overstatement.

17:21.050 --> 17:23.180
Lü, give me some water as well.

17:24.150 --> 17:25.190
Humph!

17:25.470 --> 17:26.940
You...!

17:27.210 --> 17:30.430
Allen, you can have some of mine.

17:33.090 --> 17:34.940
No... thank you.

17:36.730 --> 17:39.460
Are you ready for the final scene?

17:39.730 --> 17:41.790
Here's how it goes.

17:41.790 --> 17:44.460
Miss Charlotte goes back to her normal life.

17:44.460 --> 17:48.590
She tries to forget about that one 
sweet night with the prince,

17:48.590 --> 17:51.260
but the prince comes looking for her.

17:52.170 --> 17:53.390
Anything wrong?

17:53.390 --> 17:55.470
No... it's nothing.

17:56.120 --> 17:58.980
<i>What am I thinking...?</i>

17:58.980 --> 18:02.110
<i>Unconsciously, I'm following 
Allen with my eyes.</i>

18:02.600 --> 18:04.480
<i>I have to get it together.</i>

18:04.480 --> 18:06.480
Let's do the final scene!

18:06.480 --> 18:08.220
Ready, action!

18:09.690 --> 18:13.080
Has anyone here lost their hair ornament?

18:13.080 --> 18:16.620
That must be mine.

18:17.120 --> 18:18.760
Ha, you dummy!

18:18.760 --> 18:22.700
I'm looking for a girl whose eyes match this hair ornament!

18:28.980 --> 18:29.970
Could it be?

18:33.860 --> 18:35.910
It's the same color.

18:36.390 --> 18:38.290
Y-You are...?

18:38.290 --> 18:40.050
I'm the prince of this kingdom.

18:40.540 --> 18:42.260
I've come to take you back with me.

18:42.260 --> 18:46.350
Someone like me has no right to be by your side.

18:46.790 --> 18:50.440
Because I'm the child of a mistress and everyone hates me...

18:50.440 --> 18:52.280
That doesn't matter.

18:52.280 --> 18:55.750
No, I'm certain that I will cause you trouble.

18:56.620 --> 18:57.790
So...

18:57.790 --> 18:58.840
It's all right.

18:59.670 --> 19:01.940
I won't let go of your hand.

19:01.940 --> 19:04.400
I swear I'll protect you!

19:04.840 --> 19:06.670
So come with me.

19:08.040 --> 19:12.110
<i>Allen really has always protected me.</i>

19:12.110 --> 19:13.740
<i>But why?</i>

19:14.390 --> 19:18.180
Um... how do you... feel about me?

19:18.180 --> 19:20.110
<i>Huh? She's improvising?</i>

19:22.060 --> 19:24.860
<i>I must... answer truthfully!</i>

19:26.160 --> 19:29.010
<i>How do I feel about Charlotte?</i>

19:30.420 --> 19:34.810
Charlotte, th-the truth is, I...

19:40.700 --> 19:42.330
Wh-What was that?!

19:52.350 --> 19:54.950
I came here after feeling
the presence of someone.

19:54.950 --> 19:56.000
Huh?

19:56.820 --> 19:59.460
Please excuse my sudden visit.

20:05.180 --> 20:08.350
It's been a while, Miss Dorothea.

20:08.730 --> 20:10.480
Help!

20:10.480 --> 20:11.970
You're not going anywhere.

20:13.940 --> 20:18.050
Who could have imagined you'd disappear 
the day after I asked for the draft...?

20:18.050 --> 20:21.350
As your editor, that was the 
worst mistake of my life.

20:21.350 --> 20:25.040
But you were here at your 
house all this time.

20:25.040 --> 20:28.860
The basement I barricaded 
myself in was sealed heavily.

20:28.860 --> 20:33.240
So not even a masterful expert 
could have detected my presence!

20:33.240 --> 20:34.430
Amazing, huh?

20:34.680 --> 20:38.020
If only you could channel 
that energy into your writing,

20:38.020 --> 20:42.360
I wouldn't have had to waste 30 years of my life.

20:42.360 --> 20:44.690
I'm so sorry!

20:46.170 --> 20:48.550
I apologize for the trouble we've caused.

20:48.550 --> 20:50.140
This is to cover the cost of repairing your wall.

20:50.140 --> 20:51.680
Please take it.

20:50.140 --> 20:53.140
<b>WIGGLE</b>

20:50.140 --> 20:53.140
<b>WIGGLE</b>

20:51.680 --> 20:52.770
Right...

20:54.000 --> 20:54.860
Please excuse us.

20:55.140 --> 20:57.230
Help me, Mister Allen!

20:57.230 --> 20:59.640
He's going to sink me into the ocean!

20:59.920 --> 21:01.880
What are you talking about?

21:01.880 --> 21:05.570
Why on earth would I do that 
to my precious author?

21:05.570 --> 21:07.410
Are you sure?

21:07.760 --> 21:09.710
The ocean would be too lenient.

21:09.710 --> 21:12.400
Let's start with a volcanic crater.

21:12.400 --> 21:13.430
I'll die!

21:13.430 --> 21:15.680
Even though I'm an elf, magma would kill me!

21:15.680 --> 21:18.450
Shouldn't an author value any experience?

21:21.210 --> 21:25.810
How am I supposed to use a near-death 
experience at a crater for a romance novel?!

21:26.760 --> 21:28.180
E-Excuse me...?

21:28.550 --> 21:30.800
Allen, if you could...

21:31.600 --> 21:33.310
<b>PHEW</b>

21:31.950 --> 21:33.970
Oh! S-Sorry!

21:33.970 --> 21:35.050
It's all right.

21:35.950 --> 21:40.560
Um, Allen? What were you 
trying to say earlier?

21:40.560 --> 21:41.460
Huh?

21:43.380 --> 21:45.790
P-Please forget I asked.

21:46.830 --> 21:49.070
Bro, we've got a problem!

21:49.300 --> 21:50.200
What happened?!

21:50.200 --> 21:53.950
Listen, Charlotte's little 
sister is in trouble!

21:55.720 --> 21:57.230
Natalia is...?

23:30.850 --> 23:31.980
Al-Al?

23:31.980 --> 23:33.340
What is it, Charly?

23:33.340 --> 23:37.260
Next time is, "Naughty 
Visit to the Parents."

23:34.720 --> 23:39.970
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:34.720 --> 23:39.970
<b>Naughty Visit to the Parents</b>

23:37.260 --> 23:39.480
It makes me nervous, Charly.
